      "text": "A stated core principle is strict separation of deterministic financial computation from LLM narration: valuation numbers (DCF, DDM, LBO, WACC, comps, Monte Carlo) come from pure-Python code paths, while the LLM handles reasoning and report writing, with provenance tracking."
